---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---

<Layout
  title="LLC Formation Documents"
  description="LLC formation document preparation in Grants Pass, Oregon — Articles of Organization, Operating Agreements, and Bank Account Resolutions."
>
  <section class="page-hero reveal">
    <div class="page-hero__inner">
      <h1>Get Your LLC Properly Documented.</h1>
      <p>Articles of Organization, Operating Agreements, and Bank Account Resolutions — everything your LLC needs to be correctly set up on paper.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content reveal delay-1">
    <div class="content__inner">

      <h2>LLC Formation Document Preparation</h2>
      <p>Forming an LLC in Oregon is a straightforward process, but it requires specific documents to be prepared and filed correctly. We prepare the documents you need, clearly and accurately, so your business is set up on solid ground from the start.</p>

      <h2>What We Prepare</h2>

      <h3>Articles of Organization</h3>
      <p>The foundational document that officially establishes your LLC with the State of Oregon. It names the business, identifies the registered agent, and establishes the basic structure of the company.</p>

      <h3>Operating Agreement</h3>
      <p>An Operating Agreement outlines how your LLC will be run — ownership percentages, member roles, voting rights, profit distribution, and what happens if a member leaves or the business dissolves. Even single-member LLCs benefit from having one in place.</p>

      <h3>Resolution to Open a Bank Account</h3>
      <p>Most banks require a formal resolution authorizing the LLC to open a business bank account and identifying who has signing authority. We prepare this document so you can walk into your bank ready to go.</p>

      <h2>We Handle the Registration</h2>
      <p>Once your documents are prepared, we file your Articles of Organization directly with the Oregon Secretary of State on your behalf. You don't need to navigate the state filing process yourself — we take care of it from preparation through registration.</p>

      <div class="packages__probate-callout">
        <strong>Please note:</strong> The Oregon Secretary of State charges a filing fee to register your LLC. This fee is set by the state and is not included in our document preparation fee. We will provide the current fee amount at the time of your appointment.
      </div>

      <div class="packages__cta" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href={`${base}contact-us/`}>Book an Appointment</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={`${base}contact-us/`} style="margin-left: 12px;">Ask a Question</a>
        <p class="packages__guarantee">If there is ever an error in your documents due to our preparation, we will correct it at no charge.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="assurance reveal delay-2">
    <div class="assurance__inner">
      <h2>Start Your Business on Solid Ground.</h2>
      <p>Family owned and operated since 1995. We prepare your LLC documents in person at our Grants Pass office — plain language, no surprises, and everything explained along the way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
